	(text "XM125 radar water-level sensor. VBAT -> U2 1.8 V LDO, EN = VSENS: the module is unpowered while the host has VSENS off.\nXM125 VIN and 1V8 both on +1V8 (single 1.8 V supply, datasheet 3.1), so all module I/O is 1.8 V.\nU3 (I2C), U4 (WAKE_UP), U5 (MCU_INT): Ioff / VCC isolation, high-Z when either supply is off -> no back-powering."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 12.7 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "7526c9a1-8548-454f-acc8-7b97a153528d")
	)
	(text "RADAR_RST high = XM125 held in reset (Q1 open drain on NRESET).\nThe STM32 has its own NRST pull-up; R2 keeps Q1 off while the host pin floats."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 190.5 30.48 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "5b03055f-d5c9-42b5-b4f4-d25e91dd9c30")
	)
	(text "Test pads TP1-TP8 (bottom side, 1.8 V): flash the Acconeer I2C distance detector\nvia ROM bootloader (TP4 BOOT0 to TP7 1V8, pulse TP3 NRST, 1.8 V USB-UART on TP5 TX / TP6 RX)\nor via SWD (TP1/TP2/TP3, debugger set to 1.8 V). I2C_ADDRESS open = 0x52."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 190.5 154.94 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "1b4cf3e5-dabb-44ba-b131-35b068e6c6f9")
	)
	(embedded_fonts no)
)
